# In-lab routing: mtype 30002 (TS_QOE_PREDICTION) has no real consumer in the
# docker-compose chain. Routing it back to QP's own listener lets qp_default_handler
# drop it silently; the alternative (an unresolvable kubernetes service DNS)
# blocks QP's event loop on getaddrinfo timeouts so subsequent inbound 30000s
# never get processed.
newrt|start
rte|30002|qp:4560
newrt|end
